; Regression (2026-09-25): the caller's page is implicit and cannot be
; declared. An untyped first parameter `rp`/`page` used to BE the caller page
; (peeled by the Modeler); it is refused at its declaration now, with the
; spelling that replaces it (`T#(...)`; a routine that builds its result there
; takes the page by itself).
; xfail: the caller's page is implicit and cannot be declared
define Box (v: int)

function make(rp, v: int) returns Box
    Box(v)

let b make(5)
print "`b.v`"
